      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I am still living in the memory. Make more memories...",
      "translation" : "我还活在回忆里。创造更多回忆吧..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh are you level 140 yet? I won't talk to any weak adventurers.",
      "translation" : "哦，你到140级了吗？我不和弱小的冒险者说话。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When I was a young girl many years ago there was a man who I had crush on. I didn't know to tell him how I felt...",
      "translation" : "很多年前，我还是个年轻女孩时，曾经喜欢上一个男人。我不知道该怎么告诉他我的心意..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to tease his Peco Peco and wanted him to notice that I was interested. This went on and on for a while.",
      "translation" : "我总是捉弄他的大嘴鸟，希望他能注意到我对他的好感。这样的日子持续了很久。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Then we started dating somehow. It's still embarrasing to talk about it.",
      "translation" : "后来我们不知怎么就开始交往了。现在说起这事还是挺难为情的。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Anyway, we got married when we became old enough to marry. He used to say sorry for not being able to afford to buy a ring for me.",
      "translation" : "后来我们到了适婚年龄，就结婚了。他总为买不起戒指送我而道歉。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It has been 40 years since we were married and he still says ^0000ff'Darling~ Do you want to have a ring?'^000000.",
      "translation" : "我们结婚已经40年了，他还总是说^0000ff“亲爱的~你想要一枚戒指吗？”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I told him.. What good is a ring for an old lady?",
      "translation" : "我告诉他...老太婆要戒指有什么用？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I should have stopped him. I still remember his face early.",
      "translation" : "我真该拦住他的。我还清楚记得他当时的表情。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What happened to him?",
      "translation" : "他怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "He had not came back since he left home to buy a ring.",
      "translation" : "他离家去买戒指后，就再也没有回来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe old lady turned her face down with reddened eyes.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老妇人低下了头，眼眶泛红。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop talking.",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Show the ring from the Faceworm's Nest.",
      "translation" : "展示来自惊骇森灵巢穴的戒指"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What about this ring?",
      "translation" : "这枚戒指怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun]",
      "translation" : "[俊顺]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh... Darling~",
      "translation" : "哦...亲爱的~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffThe lady read an inscription inside the ring and started weeping.",
      "translation" : "^0000ff老妇人读着戒指内侧的刻字，开始哭泣。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Jeum-sun, my darling flower]^000000",
      "translation" : "[俊顺，我亲爱的花儿]^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffYou sense a warm energy emanating. Maybe this is the wish of the man who made this ring.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff你感受到一股温暖的力量散发出来。也许这是制作这枚戒指的男人的心愿。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The warm energy has inspired you with strength.",
      "translation" : "温暖的能量让你浑身充满力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The lady keeps crying over and over holding a ring. It seems to be no use talking to her right now.",
      "translation" : "老妇人紧握着戒指，泪流不止。现在还是别打扰她了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "An Old Woman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sadly, this woman does not seem to remember the past because of abrupt emotional changes. Let's talk carefully and listen to her story.",
      "translation" : "遗憾的是，老妇人情绪起伏太大，似乎又记不清往事了。小心地与她交谈，听听她的故事吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You have too many types of belongings. Let's try again after reducing the types of items.",
      "translation" : "你携带的物品种类太多了，请清理背包后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your belongings are too heavy to continue. Let's try again after reducing the weight.",
      "translation" : "你的负重过高，无法继续。请减轻负重后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Fortune or fame is not important. The most important thing is family.",
      "translation" : "财富和名声都不重要，最重要的是家人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you at least level 140 yet?",
      "translation" : "你至少达到140级了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I have a blurry memory of when I used to travel with my father's armed-merchant group.",
      "translation" : "我依稀记得，自己曾跟随父亲的武装商团四处旅行。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I vaguely remember everyone of the group were scattered after being attacked by a giant snake-like creature.",
      "translation" : "我模糊地记得，商团遭到一只巨蛇袭击后，所有人都四散逃开了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I had lost my family at that time. I do not clearly remember even their faces.",
      "translation" : "那时我失去了家人，甚至连他们的长相都记不清了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now I've made my own armed-merchant group and got my life back. But the memory of my past keeps haunting me.",
      "translation" : "如今我组建了自己的武装商团，生活也重新步入正轨。可过去的记忆仍然纠缠着我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 126,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I just stopped by this town to possibly find a record of my family and the armed-merchant group but so far I've found nothing.",
      "translation" : "我只是顺道来镇上，想找找家人和武装商团的记录，但至今一无所获。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Stop talking.",
      "translation" : "结束对话"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Show him the Old Photo Album",
      "translation" : "给他看陈旧的相册"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes! I remembered. This is the one who used to work for my father's armed-merchant group.",
      "translation" : "是的！我想起来了。这人以前在我父亲的武装商团工作。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sergio]",
      "translation" : "[塞尔吉奥]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Oh my... There are other pictures here too...",
      "translation" : "天哪...这里还有其他照片..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffA smile of lonely satisfaction spreads over the face of Sergio while looking at a photo album.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff塞尔吉奥望着相册，脸上浮现出寂寥而满足的微笑。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000ffA gentle energy surrounds Sergio.^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000ff一股温柔的力量环绕着塞尔吉奥。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You are touched by seeing the satisfaction on Sergio's face.",
      "translation" : "看到塞尔吉奥满足的神情，你深受感动。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sergio keeps looking at the photo album. Let's leave him alone.",
      "translation" : "塞尔吉奥仍在翻看相册，先别打扰他吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Exotic Merchant",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can talk to Sergio again when you pick up a new photo album from the Faceworm's Nest.",
      "translation" : "从惊骇森灵巢穴找到新的相册后，可以再来与塞尔吉奥交谈。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You have too many types of belongings. Let's try again after reducing the types of items.",
      "translation" : "你携带的物品种类太多了，请清理背包后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Your belongings are too heavy to continue. Let's try again after reducing the weight.",
      "translation" : "你的负重过高，无法继续。请减轻负重后再试。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What can I do for you?",
      "translation" : "有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Are you at least level 140 yet?",
      "translation" : "你至少达到140级了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to be a servant to a very wealthy lady. She was always kind to me but she suffered from a severe cough that wouldn't go away unless she took a special pill.",
      "translation" : "我曾是一位富有女士的仆人。她总是待我很好，却一直咳嗽不止，只有服用一种特殊药丸才能缓解。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I used to get the pill from a group of armed-merchants but I heard that they were attacked by a snake and that's when I couldn't get any more pills.",
      "translation" : "我以前从一支武装商团那里买药丸，但听说他们遭到一条蛇袭击，从那以后我就再也买不到药了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I searched everywhere but no one could get that pill for me so eventually my lady passed away. If it wasn't for that slithering...",
      "translation" : "我到处寻找，却没人能弄到那种药丸。最后，我的主人还是去世了。要不是那条蛇..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Do you want to revenge?",
      "translation" : "你想复仇吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Well...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dol-Seoi]",
      "translation" : "[多尔索伊]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Strong Looking Man",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes... But, I have nothing to do with that snake. I am just a worthless servant who once served for my lady.",
      "translation" : "是的...但我和那条蛇毫无关系。我只是曾经服侍过主人的一个无用仆人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
